     1570   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF rs-1 IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1571   DO:
     1572       assign
     1573           rs-1
     1574       .
     1575       run host-select in this-procedure (
     1576           input rs-1
     1577       ) .
     1578       run manage-rs-1 in this-procedure.
     1579   END.
     1580   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF RS-action IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1581   DO:
     1582     if rs-action:sensitive in frame Dialog-Frame = yes then
     1583     ASSIGN
     1584     rs-action.
     1585     else do:
     1586       display
     1587       rs-action
     1588       with frame Dialog-Frame .
     1589     end.
     1590     RUN manage-options IN THIS-PROCEDURE.
